            </div>
            <div class="px-4 pt-4 pb-2 border-b-[4px] border-[#a567ad] w-full max-w-[34rem] max-sm:max-w-full">
              <h2 data-id="pg116_n0003" class="adt-h2 font-medium text-[#2b2623]">T&#x2019;i ruajm&#xeb; tok&#xeb;n dhe pyjet</h2>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
          <span data-id="pg116_n0005">M&#xeb;suesja po sqaronte se sa t&#xeb; dobish&#xeb;m ishin drur&#xeb;t n&#xeb; jet&#xeb;n e secilit njeri.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0006">Ajo kishte p&#xeb;rgatitur nj&#xeb; prezantim ku tregohej se sa i dobish&#xeb;m ishte procesi i fotosintez&#xeb;s, nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; Mali nuk ishte shum&#xeb; i p&#xeb;rqendruar n&#xeb; fjal&#xeb;t e m&#xeb;sueses.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0007">Atij po i kujtohej nj&#xeb; ngjarje e vitit t&#xeb; kaluar.</span>
        </p>

        <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
          <span data-id="pg116_n0009">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; Mali po ecte me familjen e tij n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; pyll, ata kishin takuar nj&#xeb; t&#xeb; njohur q&#xeb; po priste drur&#xeb;.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0010">Mali e dinte q&#xeb; prerja e drur&#xeb;ve ishte e d&#xeb;mshme, prandaj e pyeti t&#xeb; njohurin:</span>
        </p>

        <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
          <span data-id="pg116_n0012">&#x201c;O xhaxha, po ti e di se t&#xeb; pres&#xeb;sh drur&#xeb; nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; gj&#xeb; e mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r ajrin dhe jet&#xeb;n n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;!</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0013">Malit i kujtohej mjaft mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjigjja e tij.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0014">Ai pati th&#xeb;n&#xeb;: &#x201c;Po un&#xeb; me k&#xeb;t&#xeb; pun&#xeb; jetoj dhe mbaj familjen&#x201d;.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0015">N&#xeb; nj&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; apo tjet&#xeb;r, Mali e kishte pranuar mendimin e xhaxhait dhe ishte ndier keq pse e kishte pyetur.</span>
        </p>

        <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
          <span data-id="pg116_n0017">Tani i dukej momenti i duhur p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; ndar&#xeb; k&#xeb;t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rvoj&#xeb; me m&#xeb;suesen e tij.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0018">P&#xeb;rgjigjja e m&#xeb;sueses e habiti, edhe pse Mali priste q&#xeb; m&#xeb;suesja do ta kund&#xeb;rshtonte veprimin e xhaxhait.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0019">P&#xeb;r &#xe7;udin&#xeb; e tij ajo iu drejtua me nj&#xeb; pyetje: &quot;&#xc7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j&#xeb; xhaxhai yt, q&#xeb; t&#xeb; kompensoj&#xeb; d&#xeb;min e b&#xeb;r&#xeb;?&quot;.</span>
        </p>

        <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
          <span data-id="pg116_n0021">Ishte nj&#xeb; pyetje q&#xeb; Mali nuk e kishte menduar.</span>
          <span data-id="pg116_n0022">V&#xeb;rtet, n&#xeb;se xhaxhai do t&#xeb; mbillte nga nj&#xeb; dru t&#xeb; ri, p&#xeb;r secilin dru t&#xeb; prer&#xeb;, at&#xeb;her&#xeb; ndoshta do t&#xeb; kompensonte d&#xeb;min e tij deri diku.</span>
        </p>
